---
/**
 * Page-specific (how-it-works): the headline value, pulled out of prose.
 * Two filled panels stating the split (spend the model once when you file,
 * read with cheap local code every search after). No borders, no left-accent
 * bar. Scoped CSS, theme-aware via Starlight tokens.
 */
---

<div class="levers">
  <div class="panel paid">
    <span class="tag">when you file</span>
    <span class="big">Spend the model once</span>
    <span class="line">A messy transcript becomes clean notes. This is the rare hard job that needs real understanding.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="panel free">
    <span class="tag">every search after</span>
    <span class="big">Read with cheap local code</span>
    <span class="line">Ranking notes is plain arithmetic. No model goes near the job you do all day.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .levers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    /* both panels anchor at the top so the eyebrows and headings line up even
       when one panel's body runs an extra line */
    align-items: start;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    /* Starlight content owl-spacing leaks margin-top:16px onto the second grid
       child, pushing the right card below the left. Reset it so both share a top edge. */
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .panel.paid {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--sl-color-text-accent) 13%, var(--sl-color-bg));
  }
  .panel.free {
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--sl-color-gray-3) 16%, var(--sl-color-bg));
  }
  .tag {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .panel.paid .tag {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
  .big {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .line {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .levers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
